      "start_line": 148,
      "text": "  rule solutionModule\n    => Module(\n         FuncDef(\"poly\", Params((\"xs\", \"x\")), polyBody)\n         FuncDef(\"find_zero\", Params(\"xs\"), findZeroBody))"
